Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(borrow):=20equipment=20borrowing=20polish?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E2=80=94=20product-page=20request,=20stock/bad-sport=20in?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20queue,=20max-duration,=20accurate=20errors?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Server:
- submitRequest enforces max_borrow_duration_minutes with clear per-type message
- approveRequest checks live stock BEFORE flipping to APPROVED (zero → 409)
- mapDbError detects uq_one_open_borrow_request → accurate 'already have a pending' msg
- listQueue returns available_units + is_bad_sport per queue row

Client:
- MyBorrowsScreen: product-page detail view when ?type= present (image, name,
  sport, stock), compact picker fallback, start/return default to now/now+1h,
  client-side max-duration validation, footer text removed
- BorrowQueueScreen: Available column, Bad Sport pill, disable Approve at zero
  stock with guidance banner
- ProfileScreen: BAD SPORT banner in StudentActivity when threshold crossed
- AdminAccountsScreen: debounced search bar on CoordinatorInviteLog

Tests:
- T-616: max-duration rejection
- T-617: exact-max-duration acceptance
- T-618: zero-stock approval block
- T-619: accurate duplicate-pending constraint message
- T-620: queue returns available_units + is_bad_sport fields
